{offset150}{arial}Akhnaten Transmission
Message: AKH-236
Operator: Sergeant Barkod

{offset0}from: {arialbld}Alex Kolman{arial}
General Headquarters of Kapharna

to: {arialbld}{name}{arial}
Bir-El-Medina




I heard the story about the 88 mm shell which crossed your Jeep. That imbecile Karlo Von Tekton, who ordered the targeting of your jeep as top priority, almost pulled his plan off, perhaps he doesn't realise that it was the pieces of the late Corporal Fricks which were scattered about and not your own.

As far as your participation re the attack on Échar, the report is damning to say the least. You let the artilleries of Kurt Rorscham get torn to pieces while your own armoured tanks frolicked about going backwards. 

You're going to have to improve your co-ordination with our ally, I know the spirit of competition which exists between our boys, but I'm going to hold you responsible for any independent action leading to futile losses, as much as for our own allies' ranks as our own. 

Kurt Rorscham is a man of experience, you will henceforth be under his command.

Your new mission brings you to {arialbld}Bir-El-Medina{arial}, your objective being to destroy the Tekton air base at {arialbld}Chott-El-Larbi{arial}. For this you could upgrade our tanks to the new {arialbld}3-inch gun{arial}. Kurt Rorscham has the goodness of placing at your disposal {arialbld}mobile anti-aircraft units{arial}, make clear your appreciation to him and take care of this material as you won't have any more for the mission. 















{center}{device5}















{offset150}{arialbld}Alex Kolman{arial}

Incontestable Chief of the Normo Army 




{offset200}{signature1}{offset0}


